502.description:
Image generation failed at some variant. `status == "partial"`;
`images` carries the variants that did succeed; `error` carries
the failure marker.

TicketStatus.description:
`new` filed; `needs_info` the team asked a question; `in_progress` being worked on;
`fixed` fixed in `fixed_in` (verify it); `verified` the fix was confirmed; `closed`
done or not a WideCast problem; `reopened` still broken after the fix.

link_type.description:
REQUIRED. Which screen the link opens: `record` = one specific
project's recording workspace (REQUIRES `topic_id`);
`content_plan` = the Saved Ideas / content-plan screen;
`setup` = the account Setup Center; `social_dashboard` = the
Social Dashboard (statistics); `publish_schedule` = the
Publish Schedule screen.

topic_id.description:
The project the `record` link opens. Required IFF
`link_type=record` (400 `missing_field` when absent there);
ignored for the other link types.

recommended_format.description:
Optional. Which supplied format is the recommended/master
version. Must be one of the supplied `scripts[].format`;
defaults to the first entry's format.
